        "markdown": "# Gustavia Wheels\n\nCar and electric vehicle rental at Saint-Jean airport, with free delivery anywhere on the island.\n\n## Our fleet (daily rates, unlimited mileage)\n\n- Compact (Example Twingo or similar) — €60\n- Mini SUV — €80\n- Electric mini SUV — €95\n- Convertible 4x4 — €130\n- 7-seat van — €160\n\nDiscount of 15% for rentals of 7 days or more. Full insurance with a €1,000 excess included. Drivers must be 21 or over.\n\n## Opening hours\n\nMonday–Saturday 8am–6pm, Sunday 9am–12pm. After-hours returns by arrangement.\n\n## Why us\n\n- Family-run since 1998\n- Child seats free of charge\n- Chargers for electric cars at the agency\n- Roadside assistance 24/7\n\nGustavia Wheels, Aéroport Gustave III, Saint-Jean 97133\n+590 590 00 31 23 · rent@gustaviawheels.example\n\nWe accept Visa, Mastercard and Amex. A credit card deposit is required.\n\n© Gustavia Wheels · Rental conditions · Privacy policy"
